[[:db/retract 17592186055450 :question/answer-fields 17592186053937] {:db/id 17592186055450 :question/problem "Given $f(x)=2x+1$ and $g(x)=-3x+5,$ find $(f+g)(4).$" :question/worked-solution "The notation $(f+g)(x)$ means the sum of the functions $f(x)$ and $g(x).$\n\n**Method 1**\n\nTo evaluate $(f+g)(4),$ we find $f(4)$ and $g(4),$ and then add the results.\n\nFirst, we find $f(4)$ and $g(4):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(4) & =2(4)+1=9 \\\\ g(4) & =-3(4)+5=-7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nNow, we add the results:\n\n$$\n(f+g)(4)=f(4)+g(4)=9+(-7)=2\n$$\n\n**Method 2**\n\nFirst, we find $(f+g)(x)$ by adding the two functions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f+g)(x) & =(2x+1)+(-3x+5) \\\\  & =-x+6 \\\\  & =6-x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate $(f+g)(4):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f+g)(4) & =6-4=2\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-b4da891c-9eb7-5195-a3f8-0ac1c8c6f04f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b4da891c-9eb7-5195-a3f8-0ac1c8c6f04f" :answer-field/id #uuid "b4da891c-9eb7-5195-a3f8-0ac1c8c6f04f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-65020d93-ef32-58e5-bf24-738b6719f093" :answer-field/choices ["answer-191ed9fb-e1ea-5bef-892a-5baa90256a4d" "answer-2d90ba2d-f17e-5fdb-9818-2e1002340d59" "answer-325859ee-224e-52c1-a505-c5197b9a6558" "answer-e7666301-e17b-5314-afdb-d7835e5ea1bd" "answer-65020d93-ef32-58e5-bf24-738b6719f093"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-191ed9fb-e1ea-5bef-892a-5baa90256a4d" :answer/id #uuid "191ed9fb-e1ea-5bef-892a-5baa90256a4d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2d90ba2d-f17e-5fdb-9818-2e1002340d59" :answer/id #uuid "2d90ba2d-f17e-5fdb-9818-2e1002340d59" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-325859ee-224e-52c1-a505-c5197b9a6558" :answer/id #uuid "325859ee-224e-52c1-