ctions $f(x)$ and $g(x).$ \n\nTo evaluate $(f/g)(-1),$ we find $f(-1)$ and $g(-1),$ and then divide the results. \n\nFirst, we find $f(-1)$ and $g(-1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-1) & =(-1)^{2}+2(-1)=-1 \\\\ g(-1) & =(-1)^{2}+(-1)=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nHowever, since the denominator of a fraction can't be zero, we can't divide $f(-1)$ by $g(-1).$\n\nTherefore, the value  $(f/g)(-1)$  is undefined." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5a311d46-6876-5cc8-bd29-ac82b7694535"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5a311d46-6876-5cc8-bd29-ac82b7694535" :answer-field/id #uuid "5a311d46-6876-5cc8-bd29-ac82b7694535" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-f632d377-ac04-57c7-af38-4a82afb34aaa" :answer-field/choices ["answer-7494fadd-dd07-5f67-a41d-7917f368d4e2" "answer-0ace236d-44ca-52a6-8858-d6e6168991a4" "answer-e1f2e513-a3ca-5f51-9c1b-c18eeceadd98" "answer-596e74cb-e10e-56ee-8a2b-0983ab1a5c46" "answer-f632d377-ac04-57c7-af38-4a82afb34aaa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7494fadd-dd07-5f67-a41d-7917f368d4e2" :answer/id #uuid "7494fadd-dd07-5f67-a41d-7917f368d4e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0ace236d-44ca-52a6-8858-d6e6168991a4" :answer/id #uuid "0ace236d-44ca-52a6-8858-d6e6168991a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e1f2e513-a3ca-5f51-9c1b-c18eeceadd98" :answer/id #uuid "e1f2e513-a3ca-5f51-9c1b-c18eeceadd98" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-596e74cb-e10e-56ee-8a2b-0983ab1a5c46" :answer/id #uuid "596e74cb-e10e-56ee-8a2b-0983ab1a5c46" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f632d377-ac04-57c7-af38-4a82afb34aaa" :answer/id #uuid "f632d377-ac04-57c7-af38-4a82afb34aaa" :ans